foundation-p1 = prose (cons "Universal love, truth and reincarnation are terms associated with mysticism and divinity. Here they are shown to be words with precise, physically grounded meaning in an information-theoretic interpretation of identity in evolutionary processes. Universal love: Tattvārtha Sūtra 5.21, 7.11; Sutta Nipāta 1.8. Truth: Tattvārtha Sūtra 1.6, 5.30; Udāna 1.1; Nāgārjuna, Mūlamadhyamakakārikā 24.18. Reincarnation: Tattvārtha Sūtra 8.2, 10.2; Majjhima Nikāya 38. The Tattvārtha Sūtra is numbered as in the Sarvārthasiddhi." nil)
